## Files created after compilation — not tracked in git ##

## Build output: every object/module goes to objects/; the programs to the
## repo root (apost3d) and utils/ (make utils)
objects/
*.o
*.mod
apost3d
utils/eos_aom
utils/gen_hirsh
utils/get_energy
utils/get_energy_g16
utils/wfn2fchk
## libxc: fetched tarball + built tree (compile_libxc.sh fetches the
## pinned release from upstream and builds it here -- neither is
## committed; see compile_libxc.sh for the pinned version/checksum).
## Glob, not a pinned version number, so a future version bump needs no
## .gitignore edit.
libxc-*.tar.gz
libxc-*/
## OSLO visualization output (written by apost3d itself during OSLO runs,
## e.g. if run manually inside tests/inputs/ instead of an isolated
## tempdir — not required input, regenerated on every run)
tests/inputs/*OSLOs*.fchk
tests/inputs/*EFOs*.fchk
tests/inputs/*.apost*
tests/inputs/*.cube
## Python cache
utils/__pycache__
tests/__pycache__
## Test runner auto-generated reports (regenerated on every run)
tests/report/
## Misc
nohup.out
## AI-assistant reference doc — local working reference, not part of the
## published repo (architecture notes, known issues, planned-work tracking).
CLAUDE.md
## Sphinx build output (Read the Docs builds this itself; not tracked)
docs/build/
